{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>踏入冬天，天氣開始轉涼，星巴克今個冬日為大家帶嚟連串驚喜，全新節日限定飲品、暖心美食同埋精緻商品強勢登場！由全新嘅「棉花糖麻糬系列」，到港澳限定嘅「提拉米蘇醇香系列」，款款都充滿節慶特色。</p>\n<h2>全新棉花糖麻糬系列 驚喜煙韌口感</h2>\n<p>鍾意新鮮感嘅朋友，一定要試吓全新嘅「棉花糖麻糬系列」。星巴克將棉花糖嘅甜香同麻糬嘅煙韌完美結合，配搭綿滑燕麥奶，口感層次超豐富。無論係以特濃咖啡為基調嘅棉花糖麻糬燕麥奶咖啡，定係風味柔和嘅棉花糖麻糬燕麥奶醇香抹茶，面層都鋪滿絲滑棉花糖奶蓋、迷你棉花糖同可可粉，飲到杯底仲有軟糯麻糬！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261007-144871-6_17034254936af577c322fac-1024x1535.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星巴克 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1439\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261007-144871-6_17034254936af577c322fac-1024x1535.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>港澳限定提拉米蘇風味 經典人氣特飲回歸</h2>\n<p>咖啡控絕對唔可以錯過港澳限定嘅「提拉米蘇醇香系列」。提拉米蘇醇香鮮奶咖啡同特濃咖啡星冰樂覆上幼滑嘅提拉米蘇奶蓋，再加埋可可粉同手指餅做點綴，完美還原意大利經典甜品嘅香濃風味。除此之外，每年冬天大家都好期待嘅拖肥果仁脆趣鮮奶咖啡，以及聖誕薄荷朱古力咖啡亦都載譽回歸！想飲得清爽啲，仲可以揀拖肥果仁脆趣冷萃或氮氣冷萃咖啡。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/tiramisu-bliss-latte-and-tiramisu-bliss-espresso-frappuccino-blended-beverage_2_6538833956af577f63071e-1024x1535.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星巴克 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1439\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/tiramisu-bliss-latte-and-tiramisu-bliss-espresso-frappuccino-blended-beverage_2_6538833956af577f63071e-1024x1535.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>冠軍級人氣甜點 歎盡多款暖心美食</h2>\n<p>飲咖啡當然要配美食先夠滿足。今次星巴克特別聯同職業訓練局（VTC）機構成員舉辦比賽嘅冠軍得主李小煥（Joyce），推出期間限定嘅柑橘堅果撻「琥珀蝶影」。呢款得獎甜點以馬斯卡彭芝士忌廉、清新柑橘同焦糖堅果層層交織，頂部仲有精緻朱古力蝴蝶點綴，由即日起至十一月三十日喺指定香港及澳門分店限時供應。另外仲有多款鹹甜點登場，例如暖烘烘嘅芝士香草德式貝果、只限香港供應嘅蔓越莓火雞黑糖法包三文治，以及紅絲絨碎朱古力鬆餅等，用嚟做早餐或者下午茶就最爽。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/butterfly-in-amber_4_3340586646af5785bb7885-1024x1535.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星巴克 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1439\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/butterfly-in-amber_4_3340586646af5785bb7885-1024x1535.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>夢幻冬日商品 歎咖啡同時做善事</h2>\n<p>食飽飲醉，緊係要睇吓靚靚商品。「雪人奇趣冬日」同「森活節奏」商品系列已經上架，為日常咖啡時光增添氣氛。由十一月十日起，買任何大杯裝或以上嘅棉花糖麻糬系列飲品，仲可以加錢換購超可愛嘅棉花糖吊飾。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/snowmans-amazing-day-merchandise-collection_2_17349188766af574d86a078-1024x1000.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星巴克 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"938\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/snowmans-amazing-day-merchandise-collection_2_17349188766af574d86a078-1024x1000.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/natural-rhythm-collection_2_12986530646af574e98ef47-1024x1536.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星巴克 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1440\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/natural-rhythm-collection_2_12986530646af574e98ef47-1024x1536.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>香港18區美食有甚麼推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>新假期編輯已經為你整合了香港18區美食指，其中包括尖沙咀、旺角、銅鑼灣等<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/%E5%8D%80%E5%8D%80%E6%90%B5%E9%A3%9F?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%8D%80%E5%8D%80%E6%90%B5%E9%A3%9F\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">……即睇更多詳情。</a></b><br/>\n</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T08:43:57.428271+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1028,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T08:30:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T08:57:22.882538+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T08:37:29.547569+00:00","content_hash":"3e828cb8e1732b077533a7114cb4ac46c8378257f7a2c719f240240214c19485","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}